# Keep the training image's build context small and reproducible -- avoid baking in
# stray local artifacts from a dirty working tree (checkpoints, logs, model caches,
# generated norm-stats). The committed assets/itw_normalization/ JSON is explicitly
# NOT excluded here (only assets/* generally is), since it must ship in the image.
assets/*
!assets/itw_normalization/
checkpoints/
logs/
models/
.git/
